# Offline preview output (Tools/AuroraPreview). Renders are large, binary, and regenerable from the
# shipped pure core in about a second, so they are working artifacts rather than source — a 7 MB GIF
# in history is permanent, and the field it shows is not. Keep them here while iterating; attach the
# two or three that matter to the PR instead of committing them.
Tools/AuroraPreview/renders/

# Unity's own working directories for the shader-bundle project (Tools/ShaderBundle/Project). Library/
# is a multi-GB regenerable cache; Build/ is the bundle output that build.sh copies into
# 1.6/AssetBundles/, which is the copy that ships and the copy that is tracked.
Tools/ShaderBundle/Project/Library/
Tools/ShaderBundle/Project/Logs/
Tools/ShaderBundle/Project/Temp/
Tools/ShaderBundle/Project/UserSettings/
Tools/ShaderBundle/Project/obj/
Tools/ShaderBundle/Build/
Tools/ShaderBundle/build.log
